type":"Panel"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"UX Flow editor: Add step dialog","spec":{"accessibility":["The trigger and the new step are two named groups of fields; every required field is labelled, and an error is a line of text with an icon under its field, never color alone.","The dialog has a title and a description, a visible close control, and keeps a visible 2px primary focus outline on every control."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Panel dialog, Stack, Text, Icon, TextInput, Select, SelectOption, Button); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The steps, Widgets, Views and Variants listed are baked samples of the dogfood Workspace; the Widget list shows each Widget's ID with its type, and the Event is a free text field.","The Variant Select is disabled until a View is chosen, which a Variant cannot switch, so the unavailable and the enabled Selects are two Widgets and a Variant swaps their visibility.","The Find fields of the Widget and View lists and the check beside a chosen option are not drawn by the Select Widget.","A Select list is drawn inside the dialog and would be clipped by it, so a Variant that opens one also shows a blank spacer at the end of the dialog to give the list room; the app's list floats over the page.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (step, View, Variant and Widget names, the Event); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A holder of flows.write on a desktop layout, with no one else holding the Flow's edit lease, pressed Add step in the editor toolbar or pressed A (the single-key shortcut); the dialog is not offered on a tablet or phone layout.","The base state is the dialog as opened: the From step is the selected step (or the entry step), the trigger Widget, Event and the new step's View are not chosen yet, and the Variant stays unavailable until a View is chosen.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is centered over a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the Add step dialog of the UX Flow editor as built from Adapter Widgets only: a new step is added together with the one transition that reaches it, so the Flow never gains a step that cannot be reached.","interactionRules":["The trigger is a Widget of the From step's View plus the Event name typed for it; the new step is a View and optionally one of its Variants, which defaults to the base state.","The Widget, the Event and the View are each required and refused with a line of text under the field before anything is added; a chosen View enables the Variant list with that View's Variants.","Add step changes the draft only: the step and its transition appear selected on the graph, the dialog closes and focus moves to the new step; nothing is saved until Save."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"f10a5c02-3a6e-4c1d-9b0e-5d1c7e2a4f02"}],"requirements":["01a11544-619c-7fe1-a1b0-7e4695c28094","01a11544-6172-7b9f-a8d6-3412aa2f04e7"]},"variants":{"filled":{"requirements":["01a11544-619c-7fe1-a1b0-7e4695c28094","01a11544-6172-7b9f-a8d6-3412aa2f04e7"],"state":{"event":{"value":"click"},"variant-off-wrap":{"visible":false},"variant-on-wrap":{"visible":true},"view":{"value":"Overview & readiness"},"widget":{"value":"#signin-submit"}}},"from-open":{"state":{"from":{"open":true},"open-room":{"visible":true}}},"required-errors":{"state":{"event":{"invalid":true},"view":{"invalid":true},"view-required":{"visible":true},"widget":{"invalid":true},"widget-required":{"visible":true}}},"variant-chosen":{"state":{"event":{"value":"click"},"variant":{"value":"thread-sheet","valueKey":""},"vari